:: RobinTemple Corner
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Robin has been given a narrow shelf and a place at the long table in the quarters. A schoolbook rests beside temple notes.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    罗宾在宿舍里分到一小格书架和长桌旁的座位。课本挨着神殿笔记。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Robin') and $RobinExpansion?.shop>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A page from the shop ledger marks Robin's place.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      店铺账本的一页夹在书里作书签。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A stall receipt marks Robin's place.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      一张摊位收据夹在书页之间。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').bunk
  and maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') and maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus').realEstate.residenceOf('Robin')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin keeps a bunk for temple duties, but goes home to you when the work is done.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾在神殿留着床位，值班结束后会回到与你同住的家。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').bunk>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin's new cloak hangs by the bunk. <<He>> still asks the older monks what to do first, and still glances at Jordan before <<he>> carries a task into the hall.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾的新斗篷挂在床铺旁。领工作时，<<he>>仍会先问年长的修士，把东西搬进大厅前也还是会看约旦一眼。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<icon 'temple/robin-temple-bed.png'>><<lanLink ["Look at Robin's bunk", '看看罗宾的床铺'] 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='teal'>The temple assigns bunks to monks and nuns. Robin is still an initiate.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='teal'>神殿为修士与修女分配床铺。罗宾目前仍是见习教徒。</span>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<set _robinAtTemple to getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and !$robinmissing
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
<<if !_robinAtTemple>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is away. The work list and <<his>> schoolbook have been left on the table.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不在。工作表和<<his>>的课本还放在桌上。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask the attendant where Robin went', '问值班侍从罗宾去了哪里'] 'RobinTemple Whereabouts'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.vigil_result isnot 'passed'
  and (Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour gte 20 or Time.weekDay is 2 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is taking part in the trial of anguish. <<His>> belongings have been left on the table.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾正在参加苦难审判。<<His>>的物品留在桌上。
  <</language>>
<<elseif maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').bunk
  and (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21 or Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has turned in for the night. <<His>> schoolbook lies closed beside the bunk.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾今晚睡在这里。<<His>>的课本合好，放在床铺旁。
  <</language>>
<<elseif Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour is 10>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is helping prepare the Sunday service. <<He>> will come back to the quarters when it ends.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾在帮忙准备周日弥撒。结束后，<<he>>会回宿舍。
  <</language>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days
    and Time.minute lt 30>>
    <br><br>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Help Robin prepare for mass (0:30)', '去帮罗宾准备弥撒 (0:30)'] 'RobinTemple Sunday Service'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour is 12>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Sunday service has begun. Robin is near the back of the hall, helping late arrivals find their seats.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      周日弥撒已经开始。罗宾在大厅后方帮晚到的人找座位。
  <</language>>
<<elseif !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd() and Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 13>>
  <<if Time.hour lt 11>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin is carrying tools between the temple garden and the quarters. <<He>> has left a note to say when <<he>> will return.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾正带着工具往返神殿花园和宿舍。<<He>>留下纸条，写了回来的时间。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin is helping in the hall. You hear <<his>> voice when the doors open.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾在大厅帮忙。门一开，你就听见了<<his>>的声音。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd() and Time.hour gte 13 and Time.hour lt 16>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has the afternoon work list spread across the table. <<He>> moves a stack of clean linen so you can sit.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾把下午的工作表摊在桌上，挪开一叠干净布巾，让你坐下。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
    <<choreicon 'sweep'>><<lanLink ['Clean the quarters together (1:00)', '和罗宾一起打扫宿舍 (1:00)'] 'RobinTemple Cleaning'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
    <<templeicon 'garden'>><<lanLink ['Help Robin sort temple supplies (1:00)', '帮罗宾整理神殿物资 (1:00)'] 'RobinTemple Supplies'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<gdom>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 17 or Time.hour gte 20>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is elsewhere. The work list puts <<his>> next shift after school and work.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不在这里。工作表上写着下一次值班，排在上学和生意之后。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You find Robin reviewing the evening list. When <<he>> sees you, <<he>> turns the page so you can read it too.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你找到罗宾时，<<he>>正在核对晚间工作表。看见你，<<he>>把纸转过来，让你也能看清。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
    <<choreicon "sweep">><<lanLink ['Clean the quarters together (1:00)', '和罗宾一起打扫宿舍 (1:00)'] 'RobinTemple Cleaning'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
    <<templeicon "garden">><<lanLink ['Help Robin sort temple supplies (1:00)', '帮罗宾整理神殿物资 (1:00)'] 'RobinTemple Supplies'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<gdom>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<!-- 承诺入口在罗宾到场时显示，避免被晚间工作分支限制而无法访问。 -->
<<if _robinAtTemple and $robinromance is 1 and ['member', 'approved'].includes($RobinTemple.stage)
  and !$RobinTemple.punish and $temple_rank isnot undefined and $temple_rank isnot 'prospective'
  and $templePromised is ''>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'approved'>>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Meet Jordan for the promise rite', '和罗宾去见约旦举行仪式'] 'RobinTemple Promise Rite'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Discuss a promise with Robin', '和罗宾谈谈承诺仪式'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _robinAtTemple and (maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').publicPromise is 'Robin'
  or $robinromance is 1 and C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60 and $RobinTemple.service gte 2)
  and Time.hour gte 11 and Time.hour lt 20
  and !(Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 13)>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').publicPromise is 'Robin'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='teal'>A thin silver ring catches the light when Robin reaches for your hand.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='teal'>罗宾伸手牵你时，细银戒在光里一闪。</span>
    <</language>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot '' and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspReady>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'>>
      <<lockicon 'unlock'>><<lanLink ['Accompany Robin to Jordan for removal (0:15)', '陪罗宾找约旦拆除贞操带 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<else>>
      <<lockicon>><<lanLink ['Accompany Robin to Jordan for refitting (0:05)', '陪罗宾找约旦重新戴好贞操带 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<lockicon>><<lanLink ['Talk to Robin about the chastity lock', '和罗宾谈谈贞操带'] 'RobinTemple Clasp'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the quarters', '返回神殿宿舍'] 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Cleaning
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.work_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 3>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You clear the bunks while Robin sweeps between them. <<He>> pauses to help a younger initiate find a missing blanket, then comes back to finish the last row with you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你整理床铺，罗宾在床位之间扫地。<<He>>在一名年幼见习教徒面前停下，帮对方找回毯子，随后回来和你收拾完最后一排。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan looks in before you leave. "Thank you, both of you."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      离开前约旦来巡视。“谢谢你们两个。”
  <</language>>
  <<grace 1>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The work is already done today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's place", '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Supplies
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.work_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 3>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A delivery has been left by the stairwell. Robin checks the list while you carry the lighter boxes inside. Some are meant for the kitchen; others hold clean sheets.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      楼梯旁堆着一批刚送到的物资。罗宾核对清单，你把较轻的箱子搬进屋里。一部分要送去厨房，其余装着干净床单。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin catches a mistaken count before it reaches the storeroom. <<He>> adds a note for the next shift, then hands you the pencil.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾发现有一项数量记错了。<<He>>给下一班留了张便条，随后把铅笔递给你。
  <</language>>
  <<grace 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<ggrace>><<gdom>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The work is already done today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's place", '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Sunday Service
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour is 10
  and $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.work_day to Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A few visitors arrive early. Robin lays out the prayer books while you help an older visitor find a seat. When the last row is ready, Robin checks the count with Jordan.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      几位访客早早来到了大厅。罗宾摆好祈祷书，你扶一位年长的访客找到座位。最后一排准备妥当后，罗宾与约旦核对人数。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin stays close as you carry the remaining books to the table. "Are you staying for the service?" <<he>> asks quietly.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你把剩下的书搬到桌上时，罗宾一直跟在你身边。“你会留下来参加弥撒吗？”<<he>>小声问。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gt 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin sets the last book down and, once Jordan has moved on, leans in. "I'm glad you're here," <<he>> whispers.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾放下最后一本书，等约旦走开后才凑过来。“我很高兴你在这里。”<<he>>低声说。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin finishes checking the next row. <<He>> catches your eye and waves, then comes over to thank you for helping.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾检查完下一排座位。<<He>>看见了你，朝你挥了挥手，随后走过来感谢你的帮忙。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 3>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<grace 1>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The service has already begun, or today’s work is finished.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      弥撒已经开始，或是今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's place", '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Whereabouts
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robinWhereabouts to getRobinLocation()>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You ask an attendant by the work list whether Robin has left a message.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你问工作表旁的值班侍从，罗宾有没有留下口信。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $robinmissing>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Robin hasn't signed in," the attendant says after checking the list. "I'm sorry. I don't know where Robin is."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      侍从查看了工作表。“罗宾还没有来签到。抱歉，我不知道罗宾在哪里。”
  <</language>>
<<elseif _robinWhereabouts is 'asylum' and maplebirch.get('Robin')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is receiving care at the asylum. The attendant has no message about returning to temple duties and suggests asking Jordan before changing the work list.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾正在精神病院接受治疗。侍从没有收到恢复值班的消息，建议你先问约旦，再调整工作表。
  <</language>>
<<elseif $robin.timer.hurt isnot 0 or C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Robin hasn't returned to duties yet," the attendant says. "The list can wait."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “罗宾还没回来值班，”侍从说，“工作表上的事可以先放一放。”
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<switch _robinWhereabouts>>
    <<case 'temple'>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.vigil_result isnot 'passed'
        and (Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour gte 20 or Time.weekDay is 2 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Robin is taking part in the trial of anguish. You can speak to <<him>> afterwards."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            “罗宾正在参加苦难审判。等结束后再找<<him>>吧。”
        <</language>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Robin is still here. Try the hall, or check the quarters when the next shift starts."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            “罗宾还在这里。去大厅看看，或等下一班开始时再来宿舍找找。”
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
    <<case 'school' 'englishPlay'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Robin mentioned school on Oxford Street." The attendant points to a note beside the shift times.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “罗宾说要去牛津街的学校。”侍从指了指值班时间旁的便条。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'park'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Robin said there was hot chocolate to sell at the park."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “罗宾说要去公园卖热可可。”
      <</language>>
    <<case 'beach'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Robin left for the lemonade stand at the beach."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “罗宾去海滩的柠檬水摊了。”
      <</language>>
    <<case 'tutor'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Robin has a tutoring appointment. The shift here comes afterwards."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “罗宾约了家教。这里的值班排在那之后。”
      <</language>>
    <<case 'shop'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Robin is working at the shop. We'll leave a note if anything needs doing here."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “罗宾在店里忙。这里有事要做的话，我们会留便条。”
      <</language>>
    <<case 'halloween'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Robin mentioned the Halloween gathering at the orphanage on Domus Street."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “罗宾说要参加宅邸街孤儿院的万圣节活动。”
      <</language>>
    <<case 'orphanage'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus')?.realEstate.residenceOf('Robin')>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin has gone home. You remember that <<he>> now shares your property, so the orphanage may not be the place to look.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾已经回家了。你记得<<he>>现在与你同住房产，不必再去孤儿院寻找。
        <</language>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Robin went back to the orphanage on Domus Street."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            “罗宾回宅邸街的孤儿院了。”
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The attendant checks the list, but there is no message about where Robin went. "I'm sorry. I don't know."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          侍从检查工作表，没有找到罗宾去向的口信。“抱歉，我也不知道。”
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's place", '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
